# Update the VNR checklist when working on VNR

When you do any work on the VNR program (anything under `experiments/`, `spec/`, `ledger/`, or the `docs/vnr-*.md` files), update [docs/vnr-checklist.md](../../docs/vnr-checklist.md) to reflect reality before ending the turn.

- Mark items `[x]` done, `[~]` in progress, or `[-]` deferred/blocked (with a one-line reason).
- Add new checklist items when new concrete tasks emerge.
- Keep statuses honest: if a run was only a smoke test, say so; don't mark a baseline complete until it actually ran.

The checklist is the single source of truth for "where are we" — a stale checklist is a bug.
